{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1311","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Perform the Combo"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You want to perform the combo on your opponent in one popular fighting game. The combo is the string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ lowercase Latin letters. To perform the combo, you have to press all buttons in the order they appear in $$$s$$$. I.e. if $$$s=$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abca"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\" then you have to press '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', then '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' and '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' again."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You know that you will spend $$$m$$$ wrong tries to perform the combo and during the $$$i$$$-th try you will make a mistake right after $$$p_i$$$-th button ($$$1 \\le p_i \\lt n$$$) (i.e. you will press first $$$p_i$$$ buttons right and start performing the combo from the beginning). It is guaranteed that during the $$$m+1$$$-th try you press all buttons right and finally perform the combo."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"I.e. if $$$s=$$$\""},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"abca"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"\", $$$m=2$$$ and $$$p = [1, 3]$$$ then the sequence of pressed buttons will be '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"here"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" you're making a mistake and start performing the combo from the beginning), '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"here"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" you're making a mistake and start performing the combo from the beginning), '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"' ("},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"note that at this point you will not perform the combo because of the mistake"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"), '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"c"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Your task is to calculate for each button (letter) the number of times you'll press it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to answer $$$t$$$ independent test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains one integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then $$$t$$$ test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains two integers $$$n$$$ and $$$m$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$1 \\le m \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the length of $$$s$$$ and the number of tries correspondingly."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains the string $$$s$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ lowercase Latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of each test case contains $$$m$$$ integers $$$p_1, p_2, \\dots, p_m$$$ ($$$1 \\le p_i \\lt n$$$) — the number of characters pressed right during the $$$i$$$-th try."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ and the sum of $$$m$$$ both does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^5$$$ ($$$\\sum n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$, $$$\\sum m \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the answer for each letter does not exceed $$$2 \\cdot 10^9$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print the answer — $$$26$$$ integers: the number of times you press the button '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"a"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', the number of times you press the button '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"b"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"', $$$\\dots$$$, the number of times you press the button '"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"z"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"'."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{